    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a Python script that registers a new user with an external provider, I need to choose a concrete external service. For this task, I will use the Firebase Authentication service, which is a well-known provider for user authentication. I will import the Firebase Admin SDK, which is specific to Firebase, to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
